      "content": "CHIPPERFIELD           \tTOWER HILL TL 00 SW  \t\t\t\t\t(East side)                                       6/93                                    \tHay Barn at -                                       \tFrenches Farm                                         \t(to E of SE Barn) GV                                      \tII Barn. C16, moved from nearer road in C20. Timber frame on red brick sill, dark weatherboarded with steep old red tile roof. A tall 3-bays barn facing W with double doors on opposite sides of middle bay. Jowled posts of large scantling with long curved braces to cambered tie-beams. Queen-strut and collar trusses to clasped-purlin roof with very wide flat rafters. Alternating wide and narrow studs in walls and deep mid-height rail tenoned in-line. Slots for wind braces now absent. Listing NGR: TL0382402203"
    }
